\pard\plain \s3\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\cgrid 
Detailed Description\par
\pard\plain 
{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Layer which contains the neurons of one layer. \par
}

{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
It performs all computations possible in a layer. In particular it calls all neurons in separate threads and triggers the compuations there. These functions are all called from the parent class. \par
}}
